  ('being-a-good-sport', 214, 'Count the good plays instead of the bad calls while you watch a game on television this evening.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 215, 'Give everyone a silly award at the end of family game night, like best groan or boldest move.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 216, 'Hum or whistle a favorite tune while you pack up after a loss, as a reminder that it was still a good time.'),
