  ('being-a-good-sport', 218, 'Point out when the score was added wrong in your favor, not only when it hurts you.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 219, 'Send a short thank you to the parent who organizes rides or schedules for your child''s team.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 220, 'Choose a game this winter that young and old can play together.'),
