  ('being-a-good-sport', 313, 'Exhale long and slow before a tense free throw or putt, then take your shot.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 314, 'Applaud the halftime performers at a spring match, even if your mind is still on the score.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 315, 'Thank yourself for one moment of good sportsmanship this season.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 316, 'Picture the winner telling someone about the game later, and hope they remember you as a kind opponent.'),
  ('being-a-good-sport', 317, 'Sit out a round after a few wins in a row, so someone else gets a turn at the table.'),
