  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 1, 'Carry one thing that does not belong on your desk back to the room where it lives.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 2, 'Open the blind or curtain nearest your work spot and let some daylight reach your desk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 3, 'Pick one calm photo you love and set it as the background on your screen.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 4, 'Place one small thing you love, like a stone, a shell or a little figure, where you can see it from your chair.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 5, 'Clear a small square of the kitchen table and call it yours for the next hour.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 6, 'Unplug your keyboard, turn it upside down over a bin, and tap it gently so the crumbs fall out.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 7, 'Notice where the light falls on your desk this morning, and slide your work toward the brighter side.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 8, 'Drag three stray files off your desktop into a single folder named Sort Later.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 9, 'Fill a glass of water and set it within easy reach of where you work.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 10, 'Pack your work things in one bag or basket so you can set up and clear away in a minute.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 11, 'Choose one cup or jar to hold your pens, and drop every loose pen you can find into it.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 12, 'Turn your chair so a window sits beside you rather than behind your screen, if you can.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 13, 'Close every browser tab you have not looked at since this morning.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 14, 'Write a short kind note to yourself and tuck it under the corner of your screen.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 15, 'Wipe down the shared table when you finish, leaving it as nice as you found it.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 16, 'Test each pen in the cup on a scrap of paper this morning, and let go of any that have run dry.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 17, 'Move your lamp so it lights the paper or keyboard in front of you instead of shining toward your face.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 18, 'Open your downloads folder and delete five files you will never need again.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 19, 'Stand a photo that makes you smile beside your screen, where you will catch it as you work.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 20, 'Ask the people you live with what time the kitchen table needs to be clear for dinner.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 21, 'Gather the cables on your work surface and loosely bundle the ones you rarely unplug with a twist tie or a ribbon.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 22, 'Swap a harsh overhead light for a desk lamp for one hour this afternoon and see how the room feels.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 23, 'Turn off sound for one app that pings you more than it helps.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 24, 'Bring a favorite small book to keep in your desk drawer for a page or two at lunch.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 25, 'Put on headphones as a quiet signal that you are focusing, and let others know what it means.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 26, 'Peel off old tape marks or sticker bits from your desk so the surface looks smooth and plain.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 27, 'Clean the window nearest where you work, even just the inside, so more light comes through.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 28, 'Rename one vaguely named file so its name tells you exactly what is inside.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 29, 'Set out a small handmade item, like a coaster or bowl someone made, and use it at your desk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 30, 'Choose a seat at the library with your back to the busy walkways.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 31, 'Wipe down the one patch of table where you set your laptop or notebook, so it feels fresh to sit at.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 32, 'Wipe the dust off your lamp shade, with the lamp switched off and cool, so it gives a softer, clearer light.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 33, 'Before lunch, archive ten old emails you have already dealt with.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 34, 'Tie a ribbon or small charm to your work bag or lanyard so it feels like yours.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 35, 'Bring a small cloth or placemat to lay down in a cafe, so the spot feels like your own.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 36, 'Put away every item on your desk you have not touched in a while, leaving out only what you need today.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 37, 'Close the door to a bright hallway light that spills into your work corner in the evening.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 38, 'Choose a soft, muted color theme for your screen if your device offers one.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 39, 'Keep your favorite mug at your workspace and rinse it at the end of the day.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 40, 'Set a gentle alarm a few minutes before dinner so you have time to pack up calmly.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 41, 'Set a shallow tray or folder at one corner of your desk as the landing spot for papers that come in.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 42, 'On a dark winter morning, switch on a lamp before you start work instead of working in the gloom.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 43, 'Silence notifications for the next hour while you work on one thing.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 44, 'Wrap your notebook in a cover made from a scrap of fabric you like.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 45, 'Keep your voice low on calls in a shared space, or step outside to take them.'),
