  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 47, 'In summer, draw a curtain halfway at midday so the sun warms the room less and the light softens.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 48, 'Make a folder called Done and move finished projects into it this afternoon.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 49, 'Add a soft scent you like, such as a sachet of dried lavender, near where you work.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 50, 'Carry your cup and any napkins back to the counter when you leave the cafe.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 51, 'Recycle the papers that only need recycling, right now, before they settle back into the pile.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 52, 'Sit facing the window on your next video call, so soft daylight falls on your face.'),
