  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 54, 'Frame a drawing a child or friend made for you and stand it near your screen.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 55, 'Check where the nearest restroom, water and exit are when you settle into a new workspace.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 56, 'Spend five minutes at the end of your workday putting your desk back the way you want to find it tomorrow.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 57, 'Listen for one minute with your eyes closed at your desk, and name every sound you hear.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 58, 'On a gray winter morning, open your to-do app and remove one task you no longer need to do.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 59, 'Write the name of someone who believes in you on a sticky note inside a drawer you open often.'),
