  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 61, 'Leave one sticky note on your cleared desk tonight with the first small task for the morning.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 62, 'Shut the window on the side of a noisy street during calls, and open a quieter one instead.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 63, 'Sign out of one website or app account you no longer use, then delete the account if you can.'),
