  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 282, 'When summer turns humid, put a cotton cover over a plastic or leather seat so your chair feels cooler.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 283, 'Remove duplicate copies of the same file so only the latest version remains.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 284, 'Bring in a little autumn touch, like a single colorful leaf or a pinecone from your yard.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 285, 'Let a coworker borrow your quiet corner when they need it more than you do.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 286, 'Write a simple label for each folder or tray you use, so papers have an obvious place to land.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 287, 'Let a few minutes of quiet into your workspace at noon by turning off every sound you control.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 288, 'Switch from typing to a quick phone call when an email thread has gone back and forth too many times.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 289, 'Wipe the dust from your little display of treasures with a soft cloth.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 290, 'Wait for a quiet moment to ask the person next to you a question, rather than breaking their focus.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 291, 'Pick one supply you have far too many of, like sticky pads or binder clips, and offer the extras to a coworker.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 292, 'Switch off one machine that hums in the background when you are not using it, like a spare monitor or printer.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 293, 'Keep a short list of the shortcuts you use daily on a card beside your screen.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 294, 'Look at the item that has been on your desk the longest, and remember where it came from.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 295, 'Book a shared room only for the time you need, and free it if you finish early.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 296, 'Look at your desk from the doorway and move the one item that catches your eye first and does not belong.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 297, 'Soften the click of your keyboard by typing a little more lightly for the next few minutes.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 298, 'Tidy what shows behind you on video calls so the corner looks calm.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 299, 'Set aside one small drawer just for personal things, so work items do not crowd them.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 300, 'Tell your household when your workday ends, so everyone knows when you are free to talk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 301, 'Tuck a small notepad in your top drawer for stray thoughts, so they stop landing on loose scraps across the desk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 302, 'Carry a loud ticking clock to another room if its sound keeps pulling at your attention.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 303, 'Leave one window full screen while you write, so nothing else catches your eye.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 304, 'Notice which spot in your workspace feels most like you, and spend a few minutes working from there.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 305, 'Make the dining table feel like home again after work by setting out a cloth.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 306, 'Spend the last two minutes of your lunch break straightening the papers on your desk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 307, 'Turn your phone face down and out of sight for the next hour so its glow and alerts stay out of view.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 308, 'Snooze one email you cannot deal with today until the morning you can.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 309, 'Ask yourself whether each personal item still makes you smile, and pass on one that does not.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 310, 'Download what you need before you travel, so you are not hunting for a signal on the go.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 311, 'Return each tool on a shop counter or workbench to its spot before you start the next job.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 312, 'In your apartment corner, sit facing the room''s quietest wall rather than the kitchen or the front door.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 313, 'Write one kind subject line instead of an urgent one when you send an email today.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 314, 'Put a small piece of your hobby on your desk, like a guitar pick, a paintbrush or a ball of yarn.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 315, 'Be gentle with yourself when a shared space is noisy, and pick one small task you can still do.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 316, 'Trace the outline of your most used tools on a pegboard or shelf liner, so each one has a clear place to go home to.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 317, 'Step outside for two minutes before you sit down to work, then notice the air and light in your workspace when you return.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 318, 'Unplug a second screen for a day and see whether working on one feels calmer.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 319, 'Keep a funny card or comic strip in your drawer for a quick laugh on a long afternoon.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 320, 'Write down how a new place felt after you work there, so you remember which spots suit you.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 321, 'Straighten the frames, pinned cards or calendar on the wall above your desk, the ones you can reach from your chair.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 322, 'Let the sun warm your chair for a minute before you sit down on a cold, bright morning.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 323, 'Check your phone''s screen time once, without judgment, and pick one app to open less.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 324, 'Greet your desk in the morning with a quiet hello before you start.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 325, 'Use a lidded cup at shared desks so a spill cannot spread across other people''s things.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 326, 'Store the things you need for one occasional project together in a single box until that project comes around again.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 327, 'As spring arrives, put away the winter blanket at your desk and bring out something lighter.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 328, 'Pause before you hit send and ask whether this message needs to go now or can wait until morning.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 329, 'Show your workspace to someone you love, on a video call or in person, and point out your favorite thing.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 330, 'Nod hello to the regulars at your library or cafe, and enjoy the sense of belonging.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 331, 'Turn off your monitor and switch off the desk light as the last step of your evening reset.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 332, 'Try working with only daylight and the room lights off for the first hour of a bright morning.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 333, 'Reply to one message you have been putting off, with just one kind sentence.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 334, 'Leave a little room on your shelf for something new you love when you find it.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 335, 'Pause for a short walk around the block between leaving a temporary spot and starting your evening.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 336, 'Pause at the door as you leave this evening and look back at your cleared desk for a moment.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 337, 'Ask your class to lower their voices to a whisper for one quiet minute, and enjoy the hush together.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 338, 'Choose a photo for your work profile picture that feels friendly and relaxed.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 339, 'Hold something small and smooth during calls, like a pebble you already own.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 340, 'Swap your work shoes for home ones when you finish at the kitchen table, as a small sign the day is done.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 341, 'Arrange your most used things so the pen and notebook sit on the side of your writing hand.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 342, 'In your truck cab, set the fan or heat to a comfortable level while you are still parked, before the day''s route begins.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 343, 'Try grayscale mode on your phone for one evening and see if it feels less pulling.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 344, 'On a snowy morning, set a small winter ornament you love on your desk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 345, 'Thank the people you live with for the quiet they gave you during the workday.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 346, 'Ask yourself, before setting anything new on your desk today, whether it has somewhere better to live.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 347, 'Set a small bowl of water near the radiator on dry winter days so the air feels a little softer.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 348, 'Step away from every chat window at lunchtime and rest your eyes on something far away.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 349, 'Add a name card with your name written in a style you like.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 350, 'Give a housemate first choice of a shared room on days you could work anywhere.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 351, 'Photograph your desk after you tidy it, so you have a picture of how you like it to look.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 352, 'Ask the person who looks after the thermostat in your shared office whether it can be nudged a degree.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 353, 'Let a coworker know which hours you check messages, so you can relax between them.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 354, 'Remember a place where you felt calm, and bring one small thing that reminds you of it to your desk.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 355, 'Notice when a temporary spot stops feeling calm, and move on gently instead of pushing through.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 356, 'Compare your desk to that photo at the end of the day, and put back any one thing that has drifted.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 357, 'Wash the cushion cover or throw at your desk so it feels and smells fresh.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 358, 'On a rainy morning, tidy your contact list by merging duplicates and deleting old numbers.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 359, 'On a bright spring morning, move your favorite object so the sunlight catches it.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 360, 'On a hot summer day, ask before opening a window or turning on a fan in a shared room.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 361, 'Thank yourself for one small corner of calm you made on your desk today, and leave it that way for tomorrow.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 362, 'Sit at your desk for one quiet minute at the end of the day and notice which change to light, sound, air or comfort you like most.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 363, 'Before you log off, check that tomorrow''s first file is easy to find, then shut down.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 364, 'Smile at your little display as you leave today, and let it welcome you back tomorrow.'),
  ('making-a-calmer-workspace', 365, 'Close your work session by saying out loud: that is enough for today.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
